    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-05-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第5题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-05",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25国考）张某8：00开车从A地出发，在A、B两地之间往返行驶。8：30第一次到达A、B之间的C点时加速30%继续行驶，并于9：00第二次到达C点。问AC距离是BC距离的多少倍？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "10/13"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "13/10"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "20/13"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "13/5"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          69
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          63
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-05-p069.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（一） · 实战精刷5 · 讲义第63页",
            "pdfPage": 69
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-05-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-05",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设原速v。8点到8点半走AC＝0.5v；之后速度为1.3v，半小时内从C到B再回C，走2BC＝0.5×1.3v。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以BC＝0.325v，AC/BC＝0.5/0.325＝20/13，选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "中间点两次到达之间是某一侧的往返，别把它当成一个单程。"
        }
      ],
