    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-06-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第6题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-06",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25四川）甲、乙两地相距150千米。小张、小李分别于8：00和9：00开车从甲地匀速前往乙地。小张开了135千米被小李追上，且于10：30到达乙地。问小李的速度为多少千米/小时？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "75"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "90"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "108"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "120"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          69
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          63
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-06-p069.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（一） · 实战精刷6 · 讲义第63页",
            "pdfPage": 69
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-06-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-06",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先求小张速度：150千米用了2.5小时，速度60千米/小时。小张走135千米时用了2.25小时，也就是10点15分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "小李9点出发，到追上只走1.25小时，速度＝135÷1.25＝108千米/小时，选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "先由完整行程确定前车速度，再定位追上时刻和后车实际行驶时长。"
        }
      ],
